  "description": "The terror man and the revival man finally meet. \"Destruction is the beginning of resurrection\". The whole world is in danger with the birth of a new evil. Min Jeong-U has the ability to see misfortune and Seok-Hwan has the ability to come back to life. The two heroes made different choices... Who will be the final winner? \n\nHan Dong-U's and Ko Jin-Ho's first crossover work! \n\n(Source: Naver, translated) \n\n*Note: The chapter count includes a prologue and epilogue.*",
